当前项目使用 `GoRouter + MaterialApp.router`，最适合在 [glasses_app_tokens.dart](/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/apps/glasses_app/lib/glasses_app_tokens.dart:25) 的全局 Theme 中关闭页面动画：

```dart
class _NoPageTransitionsBuilder extends PageTransitionsBuilder {
  const _NoPageTransitionsBuilder();

  @override
  Widget buildTransitions<T>(
    PageRoute<T> route,
    BuildContext context,
    Animation<double> animation,
    Animation<double> secondaryAnimation,
    Widget child,
  ) {
    return child;
  }
}

const _noPageTransitionsTheme = PageTransitionsTheme(
  builders: {
    TargetPlatform.android: _NoPageTransitionsBuilder(),
    TargetPlatform.iOS: _NoPageTransitionsBuilder(),
    TargetPlatform.macOS: _NoPageTransitionsBuilder(),
    TargetPlatform.windows: _NoPageTransitionsBuilder(),
    TargetPlatform.linux: _NoPageTransitionsBuilder(),
    TargetPlatform.fuchsia: _NoPageTransitionsBuilder(),
  },
);

final appTheme = kGlassesTokens.toThemeData().copyWith(
  pageTransitionsTheme: _noPageTransitionsTheme,
);

final darkAppTheme = kGlassesDarkTokens.toThemeData().copyWith(
  pageTransitionsTheme: _noPageTransitionsTheme,
);
```

这样当前 [app_router.dart](/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/apps/glasses_app/lib/app_router.dart:98) 中通过 `builder`、`MaterialPage` 创建的页面都会立即切换，不需要逐个路由修改。

它只关闭页面 push/pop 动画，不影响弹窗、BottomSheet、Hero 或页面内部动画。iOS 的滑动返回过渡也会一并取消。
